+## Choose a sender on a shared agent
+
+Always send the customer’s verified `from_number` on a [single outbound call](/api-reference/calls/create-outbound). Resolve the business number from your own customer record. The Owner can [require explicit senders](/api-reference/organisation/patch-outbound-settings) as an extra check. Supply `prompt_validation: "strict"` in a call request when a short purpose should stop the call before dialling.
+
 ## Check the outcome

 Use the task’s permissions and prerequisites before making changes. Read the saved result and keep an unavailable or uncertain result distinct from confirmed success. The linked guides explain the relevant recovery steps.
